<h1>Grants You Didn't Know Existed</h1>

<p>
Most people think grants are only for nonprofits or large organizations.
In reality, grants exist for entrepreneurs, artists, tradespeople, farmers,
career changers, veterans, homeowners, innovators, creators, and many others.
This guide helps you discover opportunities you may never have considered.
</p>

</header>

